{"seq":4,"slug":"esbuild","title":"esbuild 极速构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/esbuild","wordCount":1014,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"esbuild-极速构建工具\">esbuild 极速构建工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>esbuild 的核心价值在于用工程手段把构建速度提升一到两个数量级：以 Go 编写以获取原生性能、从零实现解析器以避免 AST 序列化开销、在解析/打印/生成各阶段充分并行，并尽量减少内存中的重复遍历。它同时提供 Build API（分析依赖图、输出打包产物）与 Transform API（只做单文件语法转换）两种入口，前者用于打包，后者多被其他工具（如 Vite 的依赖预构建）复用。代价是功能上的克制——插件能力、代码分割与产物质量都不及 Webpack/Rollup。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"极速构建的先驱\">极速构建的先驱</h2><p>esbuild 由 Evan Wallace（Figma 联合创始人）用 Go 语言编写，于 2020 年发布。它的出现在前端构建领域引发了一场&quot;性能革命&quot;——在大多数场景下，esbuild 的构建速度比基于 JavaScript 的工具快 10 到 100 倍。这种性能优势不是来自算法优化，而是来自底层语言选择和架构设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 性能对比 - 打包 Three.js&#10;        ESBUILD[esbuild&lt;br/&gt;0.33s]&#10;        ROLLUP[Rollup + terser&lt;br/&gt;32s]&#10;        WEBPACK[Webpack 5&lt;br/&gt;41s]&#10;        PARCEL[Parcel 2&lt;br/&gt;35s]&#10;    end&#10;\">graph LR\n    subgraph 性能对比 - 打包 Three.js\n        ESBUILD[esbuild&lt;br/&gt;0.33s]\n        ROLLUP[Rollup + terser&lt;br/&gt;32s]\n        WEBPACK[Webpack 5&lt;br/&gt;41s]\n        PARCEL[Parcel 2&lt;br/&gt;35s]\n    end\n</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这么快\">为什么这么快？</h2><p>esbuild 的极速性能来自四个关键设计决策：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-go-语言的原生性能\">1. Go 语言的原生性能</h3><p>Go 编译为原生机器码，没有 JavaScript 的 JIT 编译开销和垃圾回收暂停。Go 的 goroutine 机制使并行处理成本极低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-从零实现的解析器\">2. 从零实现的解析器</h3><p>esbuild 没有使用现有的 JavaScript 解析库，而是从零实现了自己的解析器。这避免了 AST 的序列化/反序列化开销，解析结果直接在内存中使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-充分的并行化\">3. 充分的并行化</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 传统打包器 - 串行&#10;        A1[解析 A] --&gt; A2[解析 B] --&gt; A3[解析 C] --&gt; A4[打包]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph esbuild - 并行&#10;        B1[解析 A]&#10;        B2[解析 B]&#10;        B3[解析 C]&#10;        B1 --&gt; B4[打包]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B4&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 传统打包器 - 串行\n        A1[解析 A] --&gt; A2[解析 B] --&gt; A3[解析 C] --&gt; A4[打包]\n    end\n    subgraph esbuild - 并行\n        B1[解析 A]\n        B2[解析 B]\n        B3[解析 C]\n        B1 --&gt; B4[打包]\n        B2 --&gt; B4\n        B3 --&gt; B4\n    end</pre><p>esbuild 的解析、链接和代码生成阶段都是高度并行的。多个文件可以同时被解析和转换，充分利用多核 CPU。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-最小化内存分配\">4. 最小化内存分配</h3><p>esbuild 精心设计了数据结构，减少内存分配次数和 GC 压力。AST 节点使用紧凑的内存布局，避免了 JavaScript 对象的内存开销。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心功能\">核心功能</h2><h3 id=\"打包\">打包</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import * as esbuild from &#39;esbuild&#39;;&#10;&#10;await esbuild.build({&#10;  entryPoints: [&#39;src/index.ts&#39;],&#10;  bundle: true,&#10;  outdir: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;  format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;  splitting: true,&#10;  sourcemap: true,&#10;  target: [&#39;es2020&#39;],&#10;  minify: true,&#10;  metafile: true,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'esbuild'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entryPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outdir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  splitting: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sourcemap: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'es2020'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minify: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metafile: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"转换-不打包\">转换（不打包）</h3><p>esbuild 可以单独用作转换器，不进行打包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import * as esbuild from &#39;esbuild&#39;;&#10;&#10;const result = await esbuild.transform(tsCode, {&#10;  loader: &#39;tsx&#39;,&#10;  target: &#39;es2020&#39;,&#10;  jsx: &#39;automatic&#39;,&#10;  jsxImportSource: &#39;react&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;console.log(result.code);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'esbuild'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tsCode, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loader: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'es2020'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jsx: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'automatic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jsxImportSource: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.code);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cli-使用\">CLI 使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 打包&#10;esbuild src/index.ts --bundle --outdir=dist --format=esm --minify&#10;&#10;# 转换单个文件&#10;esbuild src/app.tsx --loader=tsx --target=es2020&#10;&#10;# 开发服务器&#10;esbuild src/index.ts --bundle --servedir=public --serve=8000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">esbuild</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/index.ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bundle</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --outdir=dist</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=esm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --minify</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 转换单个文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">esbuild</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/app.tsx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --loader=tsx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target=es2020</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 开发服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">esbuild</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/index.ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bundle</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --servedir=public</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --serve=8000</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"配置详解\">配置详解</h2><h3 id=\"入口与输出\">入口与输出</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"await esbuild.build({&#10;  entryPoints: {&#10;    app: &#39;src/app.ts&#39;,&#10;    worker: &#39;src/worker.ts&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  outdir: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;  entryNames: &#39;[dir]/[name]-[hash]&#39;,&#10;  chunkNames: &#39;chunks/[name]-[hash]&#39;,&#10;  assetNames: &#39;assets/[name]-[hash]&#39;,&#10;  format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;  splitting: true,&#10;  bundle: true,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entryPoints: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    app: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/app.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    worker: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/worker.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outdir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entryNames: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[dir]/[name]-[hash]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chunkNames: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chunks/[name]-[hash]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assetNames: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assets/[name]-[hash]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  splitting: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"loader-配置\">Loader 配置</h3><p>esbuild 通过 Loader 识别不同文件类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"await esbuild.build({&#10;  entryPoints: [&#39;src/index.ts&#39;],&#10;  bundle: true,&#10;  loader: {&#10;    &#39;.png&#39;: &#39;file&#39;,&#10;    &#39;.svg&#39;: &#39;dataurl&#39;,&#10;    &#39;.woff2&#39;: &#39;file&#39;,&#10;    &#39;.json&#39;: &#39;json&#39;,&#10;    &#39;.css&#39;: &#39;css&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  outdir: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entryPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loader: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '.svg'</span><span style=\"color:#2